":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robert Buckley","x":"…improvement initiatives are starting to make some headway; and then three, we've taken some restructuring actions to ensure that we really ground that and get certainty around achieving that gross margin performance. So, for the most part, we feel pretty good about that 100 basis points a…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/07/novanta-inc-novt-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"NOVT 2019 Q1","e":"novt","d":"2019-05-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Matthijs Glastra","x":"Where are you in restructuring the consumables business and what's the plan and timing for margin expansion related to that?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/07/novanta-inc-novt-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"NOVT 2019 Q1","e":"novt","d":"2019-05-07","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Matthijs Glastra","x":"Secondly, we continue where we commented on in the prepared remarks, a continued momentum in our medical markets, which give us confidence to reiterate our guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/07/novanta-inc-novt-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"NOVT 2019 Q2","e":"novt","d":"2019-08-06","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Robert Buckley","x":"We are pleased with the performance of our teams in delivering our promised revenue guidance in the second quarter, especially after a weak June booking month that coincided with elevated rhetoric around global trade and tariff.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/07/novanta-inc-novt-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"NOVT 2019 Q2","e":"novt","d":"2019-08-06","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Robert Buckley","x":"In terms of the absolute tariff expense itself, it's really hitting consumer products and things unrelated to us.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/07/novanta-inc-novt-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"NOVT 2019 Q2","e":"novt","d":"2019-08-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Matthijs Glastra","x":"Third is, basically, a value engineering and Medscape process that taking cost out of our products through engineering approach.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/07/novanta-inc-novt-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"NOVT 2020 Q1","e":"novt","d":"2020-05-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robert Buckley","x":"So like, there is a cost cutting that we have done.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/13/novanta-inc-novt-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"NOVT 2020 Q1","e":"novt","d":"2020-05-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Brian Drab","x":"And I was just wondering if you can give us any insight into-I know, you mentioned some cost cutting in limiting costs, but what part of that discrepancy between my estimate and what you ended up doing was related to cost cutting and kind of what should we expect for the run rate going forward…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/13/novanta-inc-novt-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"NOVT 2025 Q4","e":"novt","d":"2026-02-24","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Matthijs Glastra","x":"Our air bearing spindles are currently the only qualified supplier for drilling AI-driven GPU boards, a direct beneficiary of the ongoing buildout of AI compute infrastructure, and this is growing at a strong double-digit rate.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/24/novanta-novt-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NOVT 2025 Q4","e":"novt","d":"2026-02-24","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Robert J. Buckley","x":"We continue to see a healthy outlook in this business with solid demand for advanced robotic applications and increasing strength in some semiconductor applications benefiting from the investment in artificial intelligence.","url":"https://www.fool.com/